 "p193_sentence": "under a Holm correction across the 51 tests whose p-values are given here, seventeen stay below 0.05 (adjusted p \u2264 0.027): the boxcar-versus-FIR differences on the full split and on the 80,000 unused rows of each board and the boxcar path's cost to LDA, the gains of three augmented models over LDA and over the deployed network and the losses of two nonlinear models to LDA after replay, NN_axi's and LDA's margins over NN_live on board A (LDA's also on the 80,000 unused rows), NN_live's margin over the LDA core of Sec. IX, and the map refit for the deployed seed. Comparisons that were run but are not reported, such as the architecture sweeps listed below, are outside this family."
